Package: baremesipp
Title: Historical French Income Tax Schedules
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mayeul", "Gourtay", email = "mayeul.gourtay@ens.psl.eu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides the schedules of the French personal income tax since
    1945, cleaned from the 'Barèmes IPP' published by the Institut des
    politiques publiques, and functions to compute the income tax owed by
    a household under any year's schedule.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/m-gty/baremesipp
BugReports: https://github.com/m-gty/baremesipp/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
